    "title": "New Virginia law targets minor's social media use - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Liam Bridgeman ,\n6 hours ago The Commonwealth is set to place strict time limits on minor’s social media use. The law, effective January 1, 2026, will set a one-hour limit on social media platforms for anyone younger than 16. It will also force social media companies to determine the age of its users. The... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
